<title>USA: John Hancock Patriot sets special div.</title>
<headline>John Hancock Patriot sets special div.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Hancock Patriot Premium Dividend Fund II said it has set a special dividend of $0.16 a share to its common shareholders.</p>
<p>The payable date for the special dividend is December 27, 1996, to shareholders of record as of December 12, the fund said.</p>
<p>The special dividend is to distribute accumulated net investment income of the fund and will be paid in addition to the regular monthly dividend of $0.075 a share, payable on December 17, 1996, the fund said.</p>
</text>
